<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτυλ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sell by the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτύλη</span>: hence, <i>sell by
			retail</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθρόα
			πιπράσκειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1347b8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				92.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.79B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲ ἐξ ἀμφορέων μηδὲ ἐκ πιθάκνης
					μηδ᾽ ἐξ ψευδοπίθου κοτυλιζέτω μηδείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					50.214
				</span></i>
			 (Thasos, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν κ., ἀλλὰ καταπάττειν χύδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					168
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρναντες . . τὴν πόλιν ἡμῶν
					κοτυλίζετε τοῖσι πένησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					683
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
